### A repository's session.

## When a repository cannot be opened or worked in.

# $error is the system's reason.
session-cannot-start = cannot start a session thread: { $error }
session-ended-before-opening = the session thread ended before opening
session-operations-cannot-run = operations cannot run in this session
# Asked of a session whose repository is not open.
session-no-repository = no repository
# The graph of a large history could not be walked further.
session-cannot-reopen = the repository could not be opened again to walk its history
